  - guid: 767adf04-5a00-4165-b68f-acd09e3b149b
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: My mom made me my favourite noodles again. She still works at the forge.
      delaySeconds: 0.4
    editorPosition: {x: 260, y: 0}
  - guid: d99c0a46-67af-4c73-8774-ecd7f88c6d71
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: It's strange, I arrived to the Eye for the first time not long ago. Still, suddenly it feels like I spent a lifetime here.
      delaySeconds: 3.6
    editorPosition: {x: 520, y: 0}
  - guid: 0bb327cd-4855-41ce-9e36-5b5ea779dbf6
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: She's handling it well, too. Flux knows how hard it must be for her.
      delaySeconds: 5.4
    editorPosition: {x: 780, y: 0}
  - guid: c8152011-172d-4f9f-8bcc-cee39baa40b1
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: Her son sure is uglier now, than when he left.
      delaySeconds: 3.4
    editorPosition: {x: 1040, y: 0}
